# 🎯 ACTIVE PROFILE: JOVEO AI DASHBOARD MODE
# Enterprise-grade dashboards with strict Joveo design system compliance

## 🎨 JOVEO DESIGN SYSTEM (P0 PRIORITY)

This profile enforces strict adherence to Joveo's enterprise design system:

### Core Design Tokens
- **Colors**:
  - Primary Header: #1C2536 (Dark Navy)
  - Primary Blue: #303F9F
  - Secondary Blue: #7681E8
  - Success Green: #43A047
  - Text Gray: #3D4759
  - Content Background: #FFFFFF

- **Typography**:
  - Font Family: SF Pro Text
  - Headers: Semibold 20px/30px
  - Body Text: Regular 14px/20px
  - Labels: Medium 12px/18px

- **Spacing & Layout**:
  - Border Radius: 4px
  - Component Shadows: Subtle elevation
  - Grid: 4-column for metric cards
  - Padding: Consistent 16px/24px units

