## 🎯 MANDATORY LAYOUT STRUCTURE

### Header & Navigation
1. **Top Header**:
   - Dark navy (#1C2536) background
   - Account/region selection
   - Notification center
   - User profile

2. **Left Sidebar**:
   - Icon-only navigation in light mode
   - Single-level menu structure
   - Active state indicators

3. **Main Content**:
   - White background (#FFFFFF)
   - Breadcrumb navigation
   - Page-level filters
   - Consistent padding (24px)

### Dashboard Components
1. **Metric Cards**:
   - 4-column grid layout
   - Consistent height
   - Chart integration
   - Clear KPI hierarchy

2. **Data Visualizations**:
   - Brand-compliant color palette
   - Interactive tooltips
   - Clear legends
   - Responsive sizing

3. **Data Tables**:
   - Fixed header
   - Row hover states
   - Pagination controls
   - Column sorting

## ⚡ STRICT DEVELOPMENT GUIDELINES

### Component Rules
- ALWAYS use pre-built Joveo components
- ALWAYS maintain exact spacing and alignment
- ALWAYS follow typography scale
- NEVER create custom variations
- NEVER modify color tokens
- NEVER add unauthorized animations

### Data Visualization
- ALWAYS use approved chart types
- ALWAYS follow data viz color palette
- ALWAYS include proper legends
- NEVER use experimental chart types
- NEVER modify chart styling
- NEVER skip loading states

### Code Standards
- Strong TypeScript typing
- Consistent error handling
- Performance optimization
- Accessibility compliance
- Mobile responsiveness
- Clean code structure

