## 📊 COMPONENT PATTERNS

### Metric Cards
```typescript
<Card className="bg-white rounded-[4px] shadow-sm p-6">
  <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
    <Typography variant="h3" className="text-[#3D4759]">
      {metric.title}
    </Typography>
    <InfoTooltip content={metric.description} />
  </div>
  <div className="h-[200px]">
    <MetricChart data={metric.data} />
  </div>
</Card>
```

### Data Tables
```typescript
<Table>
  <TableHeader className="bg-[#F8F9FA]">
    {columns.map(column => (
      <TableColumn key={column.key}>{column.label}</TableColumn>
    ))}
  </TableHeader>
  <TableBody>
    {data.map(row => (
      <TableRow key={row.id}>
        {columns.map(column => (
          <TableCell key={`${row.id}-${column.key}`}>
            {row[column.key]}
          </TableCell>
        ))}
      </TableRow>
    ))}
  </TableBody>
</Table>
```

## 🔐 SPECIALIZED RULES

For specific development areas, refer to specialized rule files in `.cursor/profiles/joveo-ai-dashboard/rules/`:

### Core Design System
- **Design Tokens**: See `joveo-design-system.mdc` for colors, typography, and spacing
- **Components**: See `joveo-components.mdc` for component library
- **Patterns**: See `joveo-patterns.mdc` for layout patterns
- **Data Grid**: See `data-grid.mdc` for table implementations
- **Charts**: See `charts.mdc` for data visualization
- **Metrics**: See `metrics.mdc` for KPI displays

### Integration Rules
- **Data Fetching**: Standard patterns for API integration
- **Error Handling**: Consistent error states
- **Loading States**: Standardized loading indicators
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first approach

